      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapOperation (priority 1500, require = 0) of the single IEventBus.post call in ForgeEventFactory.onPre/PostClientTick, onPlayerPre/PostTick, onPre/PostServerTick, onPre/PostLevelTick, onRenderTickStart/End, ForgeHooks.onLivingTick and ForgeHooksClient.dispatchRenderStage(Stage, ...) (its RenderType overload calls that one): for MinecraftForge.EVENT_BUS the post is replayed as eventbus 6.2.33's EventBus.post loop (helper bons.furious.patch.forge_listener_guard.GuardedDispatch) that leaves out a listener only when its proven early return holds (GuardTable, PrologueAnalyser, ListenerTargets, EventFacts, Profiles, AuditTrail); BusShape fingerprints the eventbus and LogicalSide methods at run time (boot-layer library classes the guard table cannot read); the group's config plugin ListenerGuardPlugin (the standard plugin plus one look at the merged class) makes a site stand down when another mod's mixin selects that method, replaces it or changes its post call; PrologueProbe = shadow verification; ListenerCensus = the read-only live listener census other switches ask by method handle",
      "license": "Forge (LGPL-2.1): no Forge code is carried; eventbus 6.2.33 (LGPL-2.1): GuardedDispatch.dispatch is a modified copy of EventBus.post (the same loop plus the skip test); Minecraft (Mojang): no code; listener classes of other mods are only read, never copied (shadow probes are built at run time from the installed class files and never stored)"
